@title: form_resubmit
@context: The form is sent, changed and sent again, and each answer reflects the change.
@tags: form
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the sign-up form
    NAVIGATE to 'Signup'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Signup'

STEP 2: A short name
    FILL 'Full name' field with 'Ada'
    VERIFY 'Full name' field has value 'Ada'

STEP 3: Send it
    CHECK the checkbox for 'I accept the Terms'
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Ada! Plan: free, country: Choose…, newsletter: yes' is present

STEP 4: The full name and a country
    FILL 'Full name' field with 'Ada Lovelace'
    SELECT 'Canada' from the 'Country' dropdown
    VERIFY 'Country' field has value 'Canada'

STEP 5: Send it again
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Ada Lovelace! Plan: free, country: Canada, newsletter: yes' is present

STEP 6: Change the plan
    CLICK the radio button for 'Pro'
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Ada Lovelace! Plan: pro, country: Canada, newsletter: yes' is present

STEP 7: Drop the newsletter
    UNCHECK the checkbox for 'Newsletter'
    CLICK the 'Create account' button
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Ada Lovelace! Plan: pro, country: Canada, newsletter: no' is present

DONE.
